      "StartBgmFileName": "MUSIC_CUTSCENE_16.mp3",
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "저, 정말인가요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ほ、本気ですか…！？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 3,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "캔들 스퀘어와 아셀루스 협회에 각각 가짜 의뢰를 보내서 서로 싸우게 만들었다고요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "キャンドル・スクエアとアセルス協会、それぞれに偽の依頼を送って戦わせようだなんて…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_002.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 4,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_2",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitPos": "POS2",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그래, 맞아.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もちろん、本気よ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어, 어째서 그런 짓을…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ど、どうしてそのようなことを…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "가짜 의뢰를 보낸 걸 교단에서 알게 되면 마신 가프님의 천벌이 떨어질지도 몰라요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "偽の依頼をしたことが教団に知られたら、魔神ガプ様から天罰が下されるかもしれません！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_004.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하하! 그럴 리가 있… 나?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あはは！そんなわけ…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_002.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_2",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK2",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…あるかな？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그… 가프님은 바쁘시니까 이런 사소한 일에 신경 쓰진 않을 거야… 아마도…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "えっと…ガプ様はお忙しいから、こんな些細なことは気にも留めないでしょ…たぶん…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_004.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 <color=#F7BE45>[대성물]</color>을 교단으로 가져간다면 천벌이 아니라 상을 받게 될 거라고!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あと、<color=#F7BE45>「大聖遺物」</color>を教団に持って帰れば、天罰どころか褒め称えられるはずよ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그, 그런가요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そ、そうでしょうか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "분명 성서에는 <color=#F7BE45>[이득을 위해 거짓을 말하지 말라]</color>라고 적혀 있었는데…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "聖書には<color=#F7BE45>「私利私欲のために嘘を吐いてはならない」</color>と書かれていたはずですが…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_006.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…뮤리엘 님이 그렇다고 하면 그런 거겠죠.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…ミュリエル様がそうおっしゃるなら、そうなのでしょう。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_007.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 어째서 그런 일을 하신 건가요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "でも、その作戦にはどんな意味があるのですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_ELF_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_2",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그야 간단하지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "簡単よ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_006.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "우리의 상대는 <color=#F7BE45>[차가운 도시 남자]</color>라고.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うちらの相手は<color=#F7BE45>「都会の悪い男」</color>なんだから。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_007.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이런 타입의 남자는 자신이 맡은 <color=#F7BE45>[일]</color>이 실패하는 걸 용납하지 못해.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "こういうタイプの男は、自分の<color=#F7BE45>「仕事」</color>が失敗に終わるなんて許せない。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이번에도 분명 자신의 모든 것을 걸고 의뢰를 성공시키려 하겠지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あいつは今回もきっと、何が何でも依頼を成功させようとするはずよ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_009.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgCrash": 0.5,
      "BgCrashTime": 1.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "CameraOffset": "POS2_2X",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만! 어쩌면 좋단 말인가?!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ところがどっこい！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_4_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아셀루스 헌터 협회의 무시무시한 일류 헌터가 적으로 나타나 버린 거야!",
